  "body": "### Summary\n\nProposed by Bybifok (GitHub moust4ki, 2026-10-26): Honest list paging — \"Page N\" without a fake total in forum lists, \"Dernière page\" disabled when unknown; exact page count per topic row kept\n\n### Scope\n\n**Honest list paging**: \"Page N\" without a fake total in forum lists, \"Dernière page\" disabled when unknown; exact page count per topic row kept\n\n- Phase: 3–4 · Priority: high · Status: proposed · Owner: —\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-022 (#50)\n\nNew engine work needed (no lot yet): `PageNavigation` exactness flag (HFRModels)\n\nEngine dependencies as written: 022, **new** `PageNavigation` exactness flag (HFRModels)\n\n### Open questions\n\nB1 settled (HFR-PROTOCOL §7b): assert the `sujetCase4` count in LOT-022 (#50) tests\n\n### Spec\n\n`docs/features/FEAT-003.md` does not exist yet; create it when moving idea → spec (ADR 0011 §2).\n\n### Source\n\n[docs/FEATURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FEATURES.md), [research/bybifok-proposals.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/research/bybifok-proposals.md); proposal credit stays with Bybifok (CREDITS.md).\n",
